  Seats and the keys behind them: run and device seats, room and seat ids, seat, device⟦f:principal-keys⟧, principal⟦f:access-tokens⟧ and token⟦/f⟧⟦/f⟧ keys, certificates⟦f:access-tokens⟧, access tokens⟦/f⟧⟦f:presence-proof⟧, authenticators⟦/f⟧⟦f:ci-attestation⟧ and CI keys⟦/f⟧.
